          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Hail, Li’sar! I return!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("The orcich camp echoes with shouts and screams. I take it Fagh-Mok’s bid to become chief has not gone according to plan?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Not exactly, no. But at least he held up his end of the bargain, and we ours. Chief Khargol is dead, and until the Whitefangs resolve their succession crisis they’ll be of no aid to Asheviere."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("Then we’ve accomplished what we set out to do. Onwards to the next battle."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
